    "summary": "CartesianPolyFilterBuilder doesn't properly account for which tiers actually exist in the index ",
    "customfield_12314130": null,
    "customfield_12310291": null,
    "customfield_12310290": null,
    "customfield_12311024": null,
    "customfield_12314138": null,
    "customfield_12314137": null,
    "environment": null,
    "customfield_12314136": null,
    "customfield_12314135": null,
    "customfield_12311020": null,
    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12444263/comment/12795080",
          "id": "12795080",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cmale",
            "name": "cmale",
            "key": "cmale",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Male",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Pacific/Auckland"
          },
          "body": "I have also seen this bug come up.  It seems that there are only 15 possible tiers, as if the best fit tier is greater than 15, then it is scaled back to 15.  So one plausible solution that doesn't require any changes to the API, is to simply require all documents have all 15 levels indexed.  The other solution is to take into account the range of indexed levels when calculating the the best fit tier, but this would require an API change, although it could be made backwards compatible quite easily.\n\nAny thoughts on the preferred approach?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cmale",
            "name": "cmale",
            "key": "cmale",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Male",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Pacific/Auckland"
          },
          "created": "2009-12-29T16:50:00.558+0000",
          "updated": "2009-12-29T16:50:00.558+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12444263/comment/12795857",
          "id": "12795857",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I think the API should pass in the max range it supports and then bestFit could just do a min on the two as the last step.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2010-01-02T12:38:55.893+0000",
          "updated": "2010-01-02T12:38:55.893+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12444263/comment/12795859",
          "id": "12795859",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cmale",
            "name": "cmale",
            "key": "cmale",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Chris Male",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Pacific/Auckland"
          },
          "body": "I agree.  I will build a patch to that effect unless there are any other alternatives.",
